-
-**Tickets créés ce heartbeat :**
-- [WIKI_SOURCED] slug-1, slug-2, ...
-- [CONTENT_R] slug-3, ...
-- [KW_DEMAND_SIGNAL] (si applicable)
-
-**Actions en attente de DEV :**
-[liste ou "RAS"]
-
-*IA-SEO Master — [date] — PARTIAL_COVERAGE*
-```
